\f0\b\fs28 \cf0 \strokec2 How to use\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\fs24 \cf0 \strokec2 Panning
\f1\b0 \strokec2  \'97 Click and drag the map using the mouse or trackpad.\

\f0\b \strokec2 Zooming
\f1\b0 \strokec2  \'97 Scroll up to zoom in, scroll down to zoom out.\

\f0\b \strokec2 Sea level
\f1\b0 \strokec2  \'97 Click and hold the slider in the bottom left corner, drag left or right, and release to update the map.\

\f0\b \strokec2 Vehicle type
\f1\b0 \strokec2  \'97 Click the dropdown menu in the top left and select car, bike, or on foot.\

\f0\b \strokec2 Route calculation
\f1\b0 \strokec2  \'97 Click a start point on the map, then click a destination. The shortest available route will be drawn and the estimated travel time shown in the top right corner.\
